# Fix weird anchor bug in gui preview

- mentioned by @KoBeWi 

The anchor system in preview scene viewport needs to have a visible node at the **top-left** corner and at least **20x20px** in size.
Or any other Control nodes will be unable to offset in positive direction (+x +y) no matter their position settings.

Fixed the anchor behavior by adding a barely visible node when creating preview scenes:
```c++
// editor_preview_plugins.cpp:882

	// HACK - Add a panel node that positions at (0,0) and covers the whole viewport, to make anchor system behave normally
	Panel *dummy_panel = memnew(Panel);
	dummy_panel->set_size(vp_size);
	dummy_panel->set_self_modulate(Color(1, 1, 1, 0.01)); // Make it almost invisible (if invisible, anchor will still mess up)
	preview_scene_gui->add_child(dummy_panel);
```

